OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with increasing
OL,6,Fsunny spells today. Any patchy cloud
OL,7,Fwill gradually clear to leave a bright
OL,8,Fand fresh day with strong winds. A few
OL,9,Fshowers possible at times across the
OL,10,Fnorth.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers will ease away
OL,13,Ftonight to leave clear spells and
OL,14,Feasing winds. Temperatures will fall
OL,15,Faway in the countryside to give a
OL,16,Fchilly night.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA fine day on Sunday with
OL,19,Fplenty of sunny spells and staying
OL,20,Fdry. Skies may cloud over at times but
OL,21,Fit will feel pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
