OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FStaying largely dry from Monday with
OL,7,Fsome warm sunny spells, although
OL,8,Fthicker cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Fare likely across Cumbria at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
